[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-snapnet-graduate-trainee-program-2026-career-opportunity-for-young-graduates-256":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},256,"snapnet-graduate-trainee-program-2026-career-opportunity-for-young-graduates-256","Snapnet Graduate Trainee Program 2026: Career Opportunity For Young Graduates","\u003Cp>Snapnet Limited has opened application for Mid-Year (July–August) Graduate Trainee Program for the year 2026.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Snapnet Graduate Trainee Program is designed for young graduates looking to build careers within technology, consulting, project delivery, customer success, business applications, and digital business operations.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Snapnet Graduate Trainee Program Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: Snapnet Limited\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Finternships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Internships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Ftrainings\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Trainings\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Structured Training\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Mentorship Programme\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Hands on Industry Experience\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Training Allowance\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>HMO coverage\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Networking\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: May 31, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Snapnet Graduate Trainee 2026 Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Snapnet is the fastest growing ICT Consulting company in Nigeria with strategic focus in developing Industry specific solutions, Business consulting and Systems Integration.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Snapnet is currently accepting applications for its Mid-Year (July–August) Graduate Trainee Program designed for young graduates looking to build careers within technology, consulting, project delivery, customer success, business applications, and digital business operations.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The programme combines structured learning, mentorship, live project exposure, and practical workplace experience within a fast-paced technology and business environment.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Successful trainees will receive hands-on industry exposure while developing technical, analytical, communication, and professional skills across various business functions.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Snapnet Graduate Trainee Program 2026 Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Snapnet Graduate Trainee Program offers the following benefits;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>1-year structured training and mentorship programme\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Hands-on industry and project experience\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Exposure to experienced professionals and mentors\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Competitive training allowance\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>HMO coverage\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Networking and social engagement opportunities\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Employment opportunities for successful trainees after the training completion\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Trainees Responsibilities for Snapnet Limited Graduate Trainee Program\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Graduate trainee will be responsible for:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Participate in structured graduate trainee programme\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Work on live business and technology projects\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Support project execution and operational activities\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Collaborate with teams across multiple departments\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Gain practical experience within business and technology environments\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Develop technical and professional workplace skills\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Participate in mentorship and learning sessions\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Snapnet Graduate Trainee Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the Snapnet Graduate Trainee, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>hold a Bachelor’s Degree or HND in relevant field\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have strong communication and interpersonal skills\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be Willing to learn and adapt quickly\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have Interest in technology, consulting, customer success, or project delivery\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Show ability to work within team-based environments\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have a problem-solving mindset and professionalism\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for Snapnet Graduate Trainee Program 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the Snapnet Limited Graduate Trainee Program 2026, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Prepare the required documents\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Fill the application and consent form\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Deadline: May 31st, 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>APPLY HERE: \u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fforms.office.com\u002Fpages\u002Fresponsepage.aspx?id=yg4TujAw4UiQicl5KTrrcBb8YgviIshKtTyIIDLMPgNURUFNWEJIM1QwWjM0UzUxMDU2MUdCMFRBWCQlQCNjPTEu&amp;route=shorturl\">\u003Cstrong>https:\u002F\u002Fforms.office.com\u002Fpages\u002Fresponsepage.aspx?id=yg4TujAw4UiQicl5KTrrcBb8YgviIshKtTyIIDLMPgNURUFNWEJIM1QwWjM0UzUxMDU2MUdCMFRBWCQlQCNjPTEu&amp;route=shorturl\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fa>\u003Cstrong> \u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>","LINKSKOOL",16,"published",0,"2026-05-21 10:05:50",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fsnapnet-graduate-trainee-program-2026-career-opportunity-for-young-graduates\u002F6a0ecaee4a8165.79134285_screenshot 2026-05-21 095821.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fsnapnet-graduate-trainee-program-2026-career-opportunity-for-young-graduates\u002F6a0ecaee4a8165.79134285_screenshot%202026-05-21%20095821.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,37,47,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":9},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[33],{"